@HospitalSystem.Presentation_HostAddress = http://localhost:5064

GET {{HospitalSystem.Presentation_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Получить список всех пациентов
GET {{HospitalSystem.Presentation_HostAddress}}/api/patients
Accept: application/json

###

### Добавить нового пациента
POST http://localhost:5064/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jan",
  "lastName": "Novak",
  "personalNumber": "901212/1234"
}